{
  "about": "Which source paths make up each UI surface, and the design spec that surface follows (one spec per surface, in leo-workspace design/<surface>.md). scripts/ci/pr_design_spec_check.py warns, never fails, when a pull request changes a surface's paths and its description does not cite the spec. leo-workspace tools/prior_art.py reads this map to list a surface's open and recently merged PRs before work starts. A path is a file or a directory (everything under it). Tests and gallery files are left out: changing them changes no design. Keep paths current when files move; the check warns about a mapped path that no longer exists.",
